00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:25.770
ng background ko?

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:27.460
Paliwanagan mo ako.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.220
Anak ako ng dating Preceptor,

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:32.700
hindi ang kanyang alagad.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:35.050
Isang Imperial Preceptor

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:37.050
ay dapat na mamuhay ng isang walang bahid na buhay.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.460
