00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:44.700
Pinalaki niya ako bilang kanyang "disciple".

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:49.050
Nang maglaon, nang lumabas ang katotohanan,

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:52.380
